Yes, **expandable format is better** for your site.

It keeps the homepage clean and aesthetic, while still giving recruiters proof when they want details. The card can show only:

```text
Company · Role · Period · 1-line summary · Click to Expand
```

Then expanded state shows highlights, tags, and deeper context.

Use this structure:

```json
{
  "headingLeft": "RELEVANT",
  "headingRight": "EXPERIENCE",
  "subtitle": "A focused history of work across litigation operations, AI systems, workflow engineering, and product development.",
